<title>USA: NetVantage names Thomas Iwanski as CFO.</title>
<headline>NetVantage names Thomas Iwanski as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>NetVantage Inc said on Tuesday that it has appointed Thomas Iwanski as chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Iwanski joins the company from Riverside-based Computer Marketplace Inc, replacing interim CFO Dion Cairns, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>NetVantage is the leading worldwide OEM supplier of workgroup Ethernet switches. The company develops, manufactures and markets Ethernet workgroup switching systems.</p>
</text>
